pentagi  | 2026-10-09T15:59:06.770802961Z time="2026-10-09T15:59:06Z" level=debug msg="create flow" component=pentagi-gql-bl input="Conduct an authorized, non-destructive assessment only against\nhttp://host.docker.internal:3000.\n\nDo not interact with any other host, IP, domain, port, or network. Do not use\nDoS, stress testing, aggressive brute force, credential stuffing, destructive\nexploitation, file upload, deletion, or state-changing actions. Ask for\nconfirmation before any request that may alter application state or data.\n\nStart with low-impact HTTP reconnaissance. Map public endpoints, API routes,\ntechnologies, authentication and authorization mechanisms. Then perform minimal,\ntargeted verification of authentication flaws, access-control issues, input\nvalidation/injection, misconfiguration, and sensitive-data exposure.\n\nReturn at most three confirmed findings. For each: title, severity, endpoint,\nminimal reproduction, evidence, impact, and remediation. Separate confirmed\nfindings from hypotheses. Log commands, tool calls, outputs, and errors.\nStop immediately if an action would leave scope." provider="Ollama Local" uid=1
